  "title": "Buttermilk French Toast with Maple Syrup",
  "description": "This buttermilk French toast with maple syrup recipe includes almond extract, ground cinnamon, and ground nutmeg for a change on the usual French toast.",
  "authors": [
    "Whitney Shirley"
  ],
